    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Start Accepting Crypto Payments in <strong>2 minutes</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>0.1% Flat Fee</strong> and <strong>no KYC</strong>.</p>\n<p>Binance Pay payments go directly to your Binance account (no merchant account required).</p>\n<p>For On Chain payments (Arbitrum, Base, Ethereum, etc.), choose between <strong>Custodial and Non Custodial mode</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Custodial</strong>: we hold the funds for you.<br />\n<strong>Non Custodial</strong>: funds go directly to your own wallet.<br />\n<a href=\"https://pay.zenobank.io/demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Checkout demo</a></p>\n<p>Questions? Check the <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/#faqs\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://zenobank.io/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">24/7 Support:</a></p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin sends order data (amount, currency) to api.zenobank.io to process crypto payments.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zenobank.io/terms\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Service</a> | <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install via the WordPress Plugin Installer or upload manually.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin under Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Installed Plugins.  </li>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://dashboard.zenobank.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">dashboard.zenobank.io</a> and create your account.  </li>\n<li>Add a wallet address or connect your Binance Pay API (this is where you will receive funds).  </li>\n<li>In your dashboard, go to Integrations <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> WooCommerce, and click Connect.  </li>\n<li>Copy the generated API key.  </li>\n<li>In your WordPress store, open the Zeno Crypto Payment Gateway settings and paste the API key.  </li>\n<li>Save changes, enable the gateway, and start accepting crypto payments.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated readme</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Lowest fees. USDT &amp; USDC Payments. Supports Binance Pay and popular wallets like MetaMask, Phantom, Trust Wallet, etc...",
    "description": "<p>Start Accepting Crypto Payments in <strong>2 minutes</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>0.1% Flat Fee</strong> and <strong>no KYC</strong>.</p>\n<p>Binance Pay payments go directly to your Binance account (no merchant account required).</p>\n<p>For On Chain payments (Arbitrum, Base, Ethereum, etc.), choose between <strong>Custodial and Non Custodial mode</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Custodial</strong>: we hold the funds for you.<br />\n<strong>Non Custodial</strong>: funds go directly to your own wallet.<br />\n<a href=\"https://pay.zenobank.io/demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Checkout demo</a></p>\n<p>Questions? Check the <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/#faqs\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://zenobank.io/support\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">24/7 Support:</a></p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin sends order data (amount, currency) to api.zenobank.io to process crypto payments.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zenobank.io/terms\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Service</a> | <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
